.env
config.yaml
# Claude Code: track the shared config, hooks, commands and skills, ignore
# personal overrides. The commands are project workflows, so they belong to
# everyone working on the repo. `.claude/skills/` is relative symlinks into
# `.agents/skills/`, which `npx skills` owns and `skills-lock.json` pins; Claude
# Code reads only the former, so leaving it untracked breaks every skill on a
# fresh clone.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json
# `.scratch/` holds the wayfinder maps and their decision tickets. Ignored
# because this repo is public and the maps carry the operator's job-search
# timeline and strategy — a plan of record, but a personal one.

.scratch/

cv/cv_base.json
cv/profile.json
cookies/
output/
logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.aux
*.log
.DS_Store
data/
*.db
.git-secret-replacements.txt
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
